<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SECOND-ROUND SCORES FROM U.S. WOMEN'S OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SECOND-ROUND SCORES FROM U.S. WOMEN'S OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>CORNELIUS, Oregon 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>Friday's second round of the U.S. Women's Open played on the</p>
<p>6,365-yard, par-71 Pumpkin Ridge course (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>136 Alison Nicholas (Britain) 70 66</p>
<p>137 Liselotte Neumann (Sweden) 67 70, Nancy Lopez 69 68,</p>
<p>Kelly Robbins 68 69</p>
<p>138 Deb Richard 68 70, Juli Inkster 72 66</p>
<p>139 Dawn Coe-Jones (Canada) 72 67</p>
<p>140 Chris Johnson 72 68, Joan Pitcock 71 69</p>
<p>141 Muffin Spencer-Devlin 69 72, Stefania Croce (Italy) 72</p>
<p>69, Michele Redman 74 67, Lisa Hackney (Britain) 71 70</p>
<p>142 Sherrin Smyers (Australia) 71 71, Se Ri Pak (South Korea)</p>
<p>68 74, Kim Williams 71 71, Akiko Fukushima (Japan) 71 71,</p>
<p>Caroline Pierce (Britain) 71 71, Dottie Pepper 72 70</p>
<p>143 Pat Bradley 72 71, Patty Sheehan 72 71, Michelle McGann</p>
<p>73 70, Pearl Sinn 70 73, Kathryn Marshall (Britain) 72 71,</p>
<p>Susie Redman 68 75, Trish Johnson (Britain) 69 74</p>
